ede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, September to October has come in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 53% of normal for October to November and 57% for November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20311 had its driest year in 1965 at 66%.</p>"}
